# covers: 11 Deadlock detection
# covers: 11 Channels
# kind: edge
# expect: trap a receive waits on an empty channel

channelDeadlock is module
channelDeadlock purpose "Trap: receive with no deadline on an empty channel nothing else can fill"
channelDeadlock path channelDeadlock
channelDeadlock imports standard.time
channelDeadlock imports standard.channel
channelDeadlock exports main

Mailbox is typeInstance
Mailbox purpose "A channel of whole numbers"
Mailbox in none
Mailbox instantiates channel.Channel Int64

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect none
main uses none
main memoryHeap true
main async true
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label done loopKind none
main label done within none
main label failed loopKind none
main label failed within none
main let capacity Int64 1 immutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main let failCode ExitCode 1 immutable
main at begin do makeNever
main at begin do makeMailbox
main at begin start receiveOne into none
main at begin join receiveOne
main at begin branch ifError receiveOne goto failed else goto done
main at done return ok okCode
main at failed return ok failCode

mail is region
mail in main
mail strategy arena
mail maxBytes 4096
mail released atReturn

makeNever is call
makeNever in main
makeNever invokes time.Deadline.never
makeNever argument none
makeNever result never time.Deadline
makeNever ownedBy none
makeNever cleanedBy none
makeNever borrows none
makeNever catch none
makeNever suppresses none

makeMailbox is call
makeMailbox in main
makeMailbox invokes Mailbox.new
makeMailbox argument capacity Int64 capacity copy
makeMailbox argument region Region mail lend
makeMailbox result mailbox Mailbox
makeMailbox ownedBy mail
makeMailbox cleanedBy none
makeMailbox borrows none
makeMailbox catch none
makeMailbox suppresses none

receiveOne is task
receiveOne in main
receiveOne invokes Mailbox.receive
receiveOne argument channel Mailbox mailbox lend
receiveOne argument deadline time.Deadline never copy
receiveOne result received Int64
receiveOne ownedBy none
receiveOne cleanedBy none
receiveOne borrows none
receiveOne catch receiveError channel.ChannelError
receiveOne suppresses none
